<div class="section_content content" id="7685727_content" title-footnotes="1"><div class="footnotes"><div class="footnote" id="ft7685727-1"><a class="footnoterefnum" href="#ref7685727-1">[1]</a><div class="ftpara">Editor's Note: Former § 359-53, Right-of-way cars, was repealed 8-7-1995 by L.L. No. 6-1995.</div></div></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7685728"
      id="7685728"
      data-guid="7685728"
      data-position="8040"
      data-full-title="§ 359-54: Slowly moving vehicles.  "
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7685728_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7685728_label" for="7685728_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7685728"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 359-54
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7685728"
    >
Slowly moving vehicles.      </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7685728" data-guid="7685728"></div>
        <div id="questions-7685728" data-guid="7685728" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7685728_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Vehicles moving slowly shall keep as close as possible to the curbline on the right, so as to allow faster moving vehicles free passage on the left.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7685729"
