  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7685736" data-guid="7685736"></div>
        <div id="questions-7685736" data-guid="7685736" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7685736_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Nothing contained herein or omitted herefrom shall be construed or held to relieve any person using or traveling or being upon any street, for any purpose whatever, from exercising all reasonable care to avoid or prevent injury through collision with all other persons and vehicles.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7685737"
      id="7685737"
      data-guid="7685737"
      data-position="8049"
      data-full-title="§ 359-60: Obstruction of traffic."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7685737_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7685737_label" for="7685737_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
