       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 359-60
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7685737"
    >
Obstruction of traffic.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7685737" data-guid="7685737"></div>
        <div id="questions-7685737" data-guid="7685737" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7685737_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="level"><div class="litem" id="7685738"><a alt="359-60A" class="litem_number" href="7685738#7685738" onclick="return false;" title="359-60A">A. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">No vehicle shall be allowed to remain upon or be driven through any street of the City of Albany so as to willfully blockade or obstruct the traffic of that street.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div><div class="litem" id="7685739"><a alt="359-60B" class="litem_number" href="7685739#7685739" onclick="return false;" title="359-60B">B. </a><div class="litem_content content"><div class="para">No vehicle shall be so overloaded that the horse or horses are unable to draw it.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7685740"
