<div class="section_content content" id="7685740_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The Police Department shall see that this article is posted in all public stables and at the hack, cab and truck stands and shall keep copies of it at all of its stations and issue them on application.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
